{%- doc -%}
  Wishlist Hero (Revamp) integration hook for product tiles.

  Wishlist Hero's docs recommend rendering a `wishlisthero-collection-product` snippet
  within product cards. If the app provides its own snippet, it can overwrite this file.

  This implementation preserves the existing design by outputting the exact heart button
  markup expected by the landing card design, with product identifiers attached.

  @param {object} product - Shopify product
{%- enddoc -%}

{%- liquid
  assign product = product | default: blank
  if product == blank
    break
  endif
-%}

<button
  class="absolute top-5 right-5 lg:top-6 lg:right-6 z-10 w-8 h-8 bg-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-brand-muted hover:text-red-500 shadow-sm transition-colors wishlist-hero-custom-button"
  type="button"
  aria-label="Add to wishlist"
  data-product-id="{{ product.id }}"
  data-product-handle="{{ product.handle }}"
>
  <i class="fa-regular fa-heart" aria-hidden="true"></i>
</button>
